目标：

```
T1(官方包) = c1aa8f7c46341ffed15589fc8170a6bb5925e85f6282d7f95ba3fdf5d303e06b
T2(运行时) = 7e68a34d461f1388620c91d76ac1113f78efb47fa3d5b5be6d025a40cd14fc3b
KA = A||B = e3b0...b855,  A=KA[0:16], B=KA[16:32]
```

